      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. It verifies the fix for IO-277 (charset mismatch infinite loop), using non-ASCII chars with US-ASCII encoding. The issues are: many unused imports, unused class fields, and commented-out dead code that muddies the intent.\n\nLet me write the improved version.Now I'll compile-check the test.The test compiled successfully. The improved version removes all unused imports and fields, adds a `@Timeout(500ms)` annotation to make the infinite-loop prevention intent explicit, and replaces the commented-out dead code with a clear Javadoc explaining why a mismatch between the source chars and US-ASCII encoding is the exact scenario being tested."
